{"seq":25,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"906c0820-686b-44eb-8449-fceb28c32cb8","runId":"run_1_1788375463194","result":"Done! The function uses `asyncio.Semaphore` to limit concurrency. When you press Ctrl+C:\n\n1. It cancels all pending tasks\n2. Waits for them to finish with `return_exceptions=True` so the CancelledError doesn't prevent other tasks from cleaning up\n3. This allows any `try/finally` blocks or async context managers in your tasks to run their cleanup code\n4. Then re-raises the KeyboardInterrupt\n\nYou can now use it like:\n```python\nfrom run import run_tasks\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def my_task():\n    try:\n        await asyncio.sleep(10)\n    finally:\n        print(\"Cleaning up!\")\n\nasyncio.run(run_tasks([my_task], max_concurrent=5))\n```","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":19889,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"906c0820-686b-44eb-8449-fceb28c32cb8","total_cost_usd":0.020353450000000002,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3055,"cache_read_input_tokens":26187,"output_tokens":2560,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":2056},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3055},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":383,"cache_read_input_tokens":13498,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2246,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2246,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1024,"outputTokens":15,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001099,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"inputTokens":17,"outputTokens":2560,"cacheReadInputTokens":26187,"cacheCreationInputTokens":3055,"webSearchRequ